        "original_id": "354fed16-fb21-5b32-b62a-87ec9895beb8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 2 Days & 1 Night, Escape to Hangover\n- People: Jung Joon-young, Kim Jong-min, Cha Tae-hyun, Kim Joon-ho, Defconn, Yoon Shi-yoon\n- Organizations: KBS2, Drug Restaurant, JJY Band\n- Topics: South Korean reality-variety shows, rock bands\n\nFacts:\n- 2 Days & 1 Night is a South Korean reality-variety show that began airing on KBS2 on August 5, 2007.\n- Since 2015, Jung Joon-young has been the lead vocalist of the rock band Drug Restaurant.\n- Drug Restaurant was previously known as JJY Band.\n- Drug Restaurant released its first album, Escape to Hangover, in May 2015.\n- The current cast members of 2 Days & 1 Night are Kim Jong-min, Cha Tae-hyun, Kim Joon-ho, Defconn, Yoon Shi-yoon, and Jung Joon-young.",
